WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:15.610
Bird loved watching the circus.

2
00:00:15.611 --> 00:00:19.870
Kip loved watching it too.

3
00:00:19.871 --> 00:00:25.234
In fact, Kip wanted to be in it!

4
00:00:25.235 --> 00:00:31.208
Kip wanted to be an acrobat.

5
00:00:31.209 --> 00:00:37.214
He also wanted to be a tightrope walker.

6
00:00:37.215 --> 00:00:43.285
Soon a lion was led into the ring.

7
00:00:43.286 --> 00:00:46.424
Everyone got very quiet.

8
00:00:46.425 --> 00:00:49.414
The lion was large and scary.

9
00:00:49.415 --> 00:00:57.714
The lion growled and roared.

10
00:00:57.715 --> 00:01:01.080
A man stepped in front of the lion.

11
00:01:01.081 --> 00:01:03.951
The man was holding a chair.

12
00:01:03.952 --> 00:01:06.731
He was a lion tamer.

13
00:01:06.732 --> 00:01:10.443
The lion growled at the lion tamer.

14
00:01:10.444 --> 00:01:14.044
The lion roared at the lion tamer.

15
00:01:14.045 --> 00:01:17.495
But the lion tamer was not afraid.

16
00:01:17.496 --> 00:01:21.550
"Sit down," said the lion tamer.

17
00:01:21.551 --> 00:01:27.865
The lion sat down!

18
00:01:27.866 --> 00:01:32.154
"Roll over," said the lion tamer.

19
00:01:32.155 --> 00:01:36.087
The lion rolled over!

20
00:01:36.088 --> 00:01:39.397
"Psst, Bird," whispered Kip.

21
00:01:39.398 --> 00:01:47.634
"I would love to be in the circus.

22
00:01:47.635 --> 00:01:52.988
But I would not want to do that!"
